[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8221.99, "timestamp": "02:17:01", "text": "如果你选择“是”，《混沌武士》结局将会如何？和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8225.589, "timestamp": "02:17:05", "text": "我喜欢……我喜欢……的开头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8230.07, "timestamp": "02:17:10", "text": "斯科特·布波普。波普。是的。开幕式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8232.549, "timestamp": "02:17:12", "text": "对吧？坦克音乐？哦，对，就是那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8235.79, "timestamp": "02:17:15", "text": "这首歌的名字叫《坦克》。我真的很喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8244.389, "timestamp": "02:17:24", "text": "我的天哪，太好吃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8248.469, "timestamp": "02:17:28", "text": "还有《马歇尔》第二季。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8252.07, "timestamp": "02:17:32", "text": "哦，这部动画真是被低估了。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8254.389, "timestamp": "02:17:34", "text": "太火了。哦，我喜欢这首歌和……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8264.629, "timestamp": "02:17:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8265.91, "timestamp": "02:17:45", "text": "那个将永远"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8268.95, "timestamp": "02:17:48", "text": "怀旧之情即将消散，就像风一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8273.07, "timestamp": "02:17:53", "text": "火影忍者。总是。总是。蓝色的。"}]